From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ruscher <rruscher@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 13:59:49 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] toolkit: Adapts the tests to the layout refactor; tests the
 usable area across layers.

The usable area is now computed by the desktop's layout (upstream
wlmtk_desktop_element_layout), each frame: The placement tests run the
layout after adding a panel. The layer tests of the former per-layer
usable area (usable_area_signal, wlmtk_layer_get_usable_area) became
desktop test layout_across_layers: A shelf in the top layer moves a row
of appicons in the bottom layer, and usable_area_changed is signalled
only when the area changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/toolkit/desktop.c   | 93 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 src/toolkit/layer.c     | 75 +--------------------------------
 src/toolkit/workspace.c |  4 ++
 3 files changed, 98 insertions(+), 74 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/toolkit/desktop.c b/src/toolkit/desktop.c
index 9e4f6e1..cf8d5ff 100644
--- a/src/toolkit/desktop.c
